From: cortex-m-rt-linkx-docs <lane@amperstrand.invalid>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 07:59:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] chore: remove stale src/comm/comm duplicate, untrack
 Cargo.lock, correct manifest
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Upstreamability cleanup (keep-fork decision 2026-10-20):

- delete src/comm/comm/ — stale duplicate of src/comm/ predating the
  e9ced1e std-gating (missing #[cfg(feature = "std")]); dead weight
  in any tree-diff vs upstream
- untrack Cargo.lock (already gitignored; libraries do not ship locks)
- description: drop the false 'upstream SPI-only' claim (upstream 0.8.0
  ships I2C — byte-identical files; see bolty-rs LEDGER correction
  2026-10-19); state the fork's actual deltas instead
- relax '=pinned' dependency requirements to normal caret ranges —
  identical resolution today, normal manifest shape for any future
  upstream carry-over

Zero src/ behavior change: cargo test --all-features 28+1 pass before
and after.
